QuestGuidance.Register("en",196,{
[6241]="70047A83\n1\tDefeat Orc Lieutenants in Skoironk (total: 5)\tOrcs can be found within the caverns of Skoironk. You should defeat Orc Lieutenants within Skoironk.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated Orc Lieutenants within Skoironk.\n",
[6242]="700698A5\n1\tCollect hidden parcels along the southern waterway in the Lower Ward (total: 5)\tHidden parcels can be found alongside the southern waterway that runs through the Lower Ward.\n2\tBring the hidden parcels to Nakûr\tNakûr is located on the western side of the Lower Ward, near the southern waterway.\n",
[6243]="70032C36\n1\tFind the ancient miners' garrison, Nud-heden\tThe ancient miners' garrison is somewhere inside the grodbog-hive, south of the camp-site of Kúli and Auti. Kúli believes the ancient miners' garrison is located in the Redhorn Lodes from an ancient dwarf-text he read in the locket. Auti and Kúli came to this cavern for mithril, but instead find themselves searching for a legend!\n2\tThe ancient garrison has been found, but it has been ages since dwarves set foot inside it. Kúli will be excited to find out the garrison does exist and is not just legend. He will want to know how dangerous the place has become and what state the legendary place is in.\t\n3\tReturn to Kúli\tKúli is camped with Auti, just north of the grodbog-hive. Kúli will be excited to hear the ancient garrison exists as he suspected. However, it may not be the safe solution he was hoping it would be.\n",
[6244]="700571E1\n1\tTalk to Skarding Wargsbane at Thokvist\tSkarding can be found at Thokvist. You should talk to Skarding.\n2\tScout the first location for Skarding\tLocations to scout can be found nearby Thokvist in Misthallow. You should scout Misthallow for Skarding.\n3\tScout the second location for Skarding\tLocations to scout can be found nearby Thokvist in Misthallow. You should scout Misthallow for Skarding.\n4\tScout the third location for Skarding\tLocations to scout can be found nearby Thokvist in Misthallow. You should scout Misthallow for Skarding.\n5\tGreet the eagle with a bow\tEgraedir can be found in Misthallow. You should greet Egraedir.\n6\tTalk to Egraedir\tEgraedir can be found in Misthallow. You should talk to Egraedir.\n7\tGather stones for Egraedir (total: 10)\tSmall stones can be found in Misthallow. You should gather the stones for Egraedir.\n8\tReturn to Egraedir\tEgraedir can be found in Misthallow. You should return to Egraedir with the stones you have collected.\n9\tTalk to Fanglind at Thokvist\tFanglind can be found at Thokvist. You should talk to Fanglind.\n",
[6245]="70007DD7\n1\tDefeat bears in the Misty Mountains (total: 12)\tBears are found throughout the Misty Mountains: near the Bruinen Source, by the High Crags, north of Glóin's Camp, and close to the Giant Halls. Malthenor has asked you to defeat bears throughout the mountains to lessen the threat they pose to potential travellers.\n2\tTalk to Malthenor\tMalthenor is located in Glóin's camp. Malthenor will be pleased to hear that you have defeated many bears throughout the mountains.\n",
[6246]="70030B5C\n1\tFollow the road south of Snowbourn\tSigeric has told you that the trail of the man he spotted begins outside the south gate of Snowbourn.\n2\tContinue along the road to the south of Snowbourn\tThe trail can be found along the road south and east of Snowbourn. The trail has been cold so far, but in the interest of Snowbourn, you should keep searching.\n3\tSearch the nearby crofts for the spy\tThe crofts can be found just off the road far to the south-east of Snowbourn. Having found a banner of the White Hand, you should investigate the nearby crofts and homes for any sign of a spy.\n4\tInvestigate the barn\tThe barn can be found among the croftlands to the south-east of Snowbourn. Following the trail from Snowbourn, you have found yourself outside a barn.\n5\tTalk to Sigeric\tYou have found Sigeric outside the barn, and he looks quite pleased to see you. You should speak to him and discover why he sent you on this hunt.\n6\tTalk to Fastred\tFastred can be found inside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn. You have bested Sigeric, the man you rescued from Orcs near Garsfeld, and now the Rohirrim have him in their control. Fastred must be told of Sigeric's treachery.\n",
[6247]="70066AE2\n1\tApproach the well across from the Melgobas stables\tAnoch has asked you to play a game with him. He'll hide, and you'll have to find him. To start, you should approach the well across from the stables in north-east Melgobas.\n2\tCount to ten\tYou should give Anoch ten seconds to hide.\n3\tFind and poke Anoch\tYou should find Anoch hiding somewhere in Melgobas.\n4\tTalk to Anoch\tYou've found Anoch! You should talk to him.\n",
[6248]="7002BFDA\n1\tScout the first patrol point\tThe brigand hideaway is located somewhere in the Brown Lands. Céola has asked you to scout the first patrol point for the location of the brigand hideaway.\n2\tScout the second patrol point\tThe brigand hideaway is located somewhere in the Brown Lands. Céola has asked you to scout the second patrol point for the location of the brigand hideaway.\n3\tScout the third patrol point\tThe brigand hideaway is located somewhere in the Brown Lands. Céola has asked you to scout the third patrol point for the location of the brigand hideaway.\n4\tScout the fourth patrol point\tThe brigand hideaway is located somewhere in the Brown Lands. Céola has asked you to scout the fourth patrol point for the location of the brigand hideaway.\n5\tTalk to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands\tCéola is at Etheburg, south of Helstor, in the Brown Lands. You should return to Céola with news of your success.\n",
[6249]="70061386\n1\tGo to the gazebo\tGildor has invited you to play a game of Hiders and Seekers. You should go to the gazebo in Tighfield to begin the game.\n2\tCount down from ten\tTime to close your eyes and count!\n3\tYou should find the hobbit children hiding throughout Tighfield. Gildor has assured you that you do not need to venture past Tighfield's walls.\t\n4\tFind and poke hiders (5/6)\tYou've found all but one of the hiders. Where could the last child be?\n5\tTalk to Gildor\tGildor is resting in Tighfield by the gazebo. He might know where the last hider is.\n",
[6250]="70007376\n1\tFind Polo Brockhouse\030Find Daisy Brockhouse\tPolo Brockhouse is hiding behind the carved wooden statue of Marcho and Blanco in the centre of Michel Delving. His sister Daisy is hiding south-east of the carving, in the bushes to the right of Peony Grubb's home. Rollo Newbuck is playing Hiders and Seekers with his friends, but they always hide in the same places, and he is tired of pretending to be surprised every time he finds them.\n2\tTalk to Rollo Newbuck\tRollo Newbuck is north of the carved statue of Marcho and Blanco at the centre of Michel Delving, within the circle of hedges that surround Town Hole. Rollo is waiting to hear that you found Polo and Daisy Brockhouse.\n",
[6251]="70025C02\n1\tCollect bear-hides (total: 10)\tNan Orngon is south-east of Ost Forod. Rowena Parker asked you to venture to Nan Orngon and bring back several bear hides to be turned into blankets.\n2\tBring bear-hides to Rowena Parker at Ost Forod\tOst Forod is west of Nan Orngon. Rowena Parker will want to begin turning the hides into blankets.\n",
[6252]="70062FD7\n1\tCollect avanc hides (total: 8)\tEtta Yewberry has asked you to bring her hides from the avanc who make the watery pools north of Tharbad their homes.\n2\tReturn to Etta Yewberry\tYou should bring the avanc hides to Etta Yewberry. Etta is in Stonecrop Encampment, north of Tharbad.\n",
[6253]="70059768\n1\tCollect hides in the Wildwood (total: 10)\tHides can be found on some large game in the Wildwood. You should collect hides.\n2\tPlace the hides in a storage crate\tA storage crate can be found in either Trader's Wharf or Trestlebridge. You should place the hides in a storage crate.\n",
[6254]="70015E23\n1\tTalk to Ruidhriel\030Collect the handkerchief\030Collect the strange branch\030Collect spent arrow\tThe remains of the battle are scattered across the Burnt Tor, west of Ruidhriel. Ruidhriel has asked you to find any remains of the battle that occurred upon the Burnt Tor and hide them.\n",
[6255]="70025A8A\n1\tFlip over rocks and defeat the crawlers beneath (total: 6)\tLithost is south of the colossus, on the west bank of the Baranduin. Herthdúr asked you to go to Lithost, flip over some rocks, and defeat the crawlers you find.\n2\tTalk to Herthdúr at the colossus camp\tHerthdúr is at the colossus camp, north of Lithost. Herthdúr will be pleased to hear the crawlers' population has been reduced.\n",
[6256]="700351BF\n1\tTalk to Strongroot\030Talk to Nindorn\030Aid Nindorn with 'A Lost Friend'\030Aid Strongroot with 'In Núrzum's Wake'\tBarallas has sent you deep into the Balewood in search of his lost fellows. He hopes to reunite with the other Ents that survived Nurzum's assault.\n2\tTalk to Barallas\tBarallas can be found at Stonecliff in northern Balewood. You have rallied the other Ents and should return to Barallas.\n",
[6257]="70061009\n1\tPotential hiding spots for the evidence can be found throughout Nobottle.\t\n2\tTalk to Camellia Boffin outside 8 Honeymead Lane\tCamellia Boffin is outside 8 Honeymead Lane.\n3\tRing the bell outside 9 Honeymead Lane\tCamellia thinks you might be able to hide the evidence of Dinodas's mistake by giving the painting to Angelica's neighbour.\n4\tWait for the home-owner of 9 Honeymead Lane to answer the door\tYou are waiting for Angelica's neighbour at 9 Honeymead Lane to come to the door.\n5\tTalk to Camellia Boffin outside 9 Honeymead Lane\tCamellia is waiting outside 9 Honeymead Lane to hear how it went.\n6\tNosey hobbits throughout Nobottle may be able to tell you something useful about the owner of 9 Honeymead Lane.\t\n7\tTalk to Camellia Boffin outside 9 Honeymead Lane\tCamellia is waiting outside 9 Honeymead Lane to hear how it went.\n8\tFind Magetha Grubb at Long Cleeve\tAccording to the rumours you uncovered, the owner of 9 Honeymead Lane is a hobbit named Magetha Grubb, and she departs for Long Cleeve every morning.\n9\tTalk to Magetha Grubb at Long Cleeve\tAccording to the rumours you uncovered, the owner of 9 Honeymead Lane is a hobbit named Magetha Grubb, and she departs for Long Cleeve every morning.\n10\tDefeat ruffians at Ost Lagorath (total: 6)\030Defeat cowardly boggarts in Yondershire (total: 6)\030Defeat goblins on the eastern side of Bâr Faroth (total: 6)\tMagetha Grubb will not discuss any personal business until villains at each of the locations observed by the Bounders in Yondershire have been dealt with.\n11\tTalk to Camellia Boffin outside 9 Honeymead Lane\tCamellia Boffin is waiting for you to return to Nobottle with good news.\n12\tRing the bell outside 9 Honeymead Lane\tCamellia thinks you might be able to hide the evidence of Dinodas's mistake by giving the painting to Angelica's neighbour.\n13\tGo inside 9 Honeymead Lane and figure out how to hide the evidence of Dinodas's mistake\tYou should go inside 9 Honeymead Lane and see what can be done with the incorrect house-warming painting.\n14\tTalk to Magetha Grubb inside her home\tMagetha Grubb is at home inside 9 Honeymead Lane.\n15\tGive pats to Hazel\030Give pats to Mother Lissome\tMagetha Grubb has asked you to pet her animals so they will be put at ease with having strangers in their home.\n16\tGive pats to Grumble\030Give pats to Nosewise\tMagetha Grubb has asked you to pet her animals so they will be put at ease with having strangers in their home.\n17\tGive pats to Treacle Tom\030Give pats to Gruntius Took\tMagetha Grubb has asked you to pet her animals so they will be put at ease with having strangers in their home.\n18\tTalk to Magetha Grubb inside 9 Honeymead Lane\tMagetha Grubb is at home inside 9 Honeymead Lane.\n19\tTalk to Camellia Boffin inside 9 Honeymead Lane\tCamellia Boffin is inside 9 Honeymead Lane.\n20\tTalk to Camellia Boffin outside 9 Honeymead Lane\tCamellia said she would meet you outside 9 Honeymead Lane.\n",
[6258]="70044646\n1\tPotential hiding spaces for Lenglír's artwork can be found on the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith. You should scout out hiding spaces for Lenglír's artwork.\t\n2\tSpeak with Lenglír\tLenglír can be found outside the Artists' Fellow-hall on the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith. You should speak with Lenglír.\n",
[6259]="70035A3A\n1\tDefeat invaders on the north road (total: 5)\tThe northern road in the High Knolls can be reached by speaking with Dudoc to travel there. You should travel to the High Knolls and reclaim the northern road from the Orc invaders.\n2\tReturn to Dudoc in Forlaw\tDudoc is in Forlaw. You should speak with Dudoc.\n",
[6260]="70035833\n1\tDefeat enemies in the High Knolls (total: 10)\tThe forces of Isengard can be found in the High Knolls. You should ride to the High Knolls and defeat the enemies of Wildermore.\n2\tReturn to Ealswith\tEalswith is in Forlaw. You should return to Ealswith.\n",
[6261]="7003589D\n1\tExamine the bases of stone peaks along the road (total: 6)\tThe southern road of the High Knolls is the most commonly used for travel. You should investigate the tall peaks of stone along the road to see if the road is stable enough for travellers.\n2\tReturn to Ealswith\tEalswith is in Forlaw. You should return to Ealswith.\n",
[6262]="70022D6F\n1\tTalk to Glóin at his camp in the Misty Mountains\tGlóin's camp is west off of the road that leads up and north out of Rivendell. Seek him out and speak with him. Glóin sent a request for you to come and visit him at his encampment in the Misty Mountains.\n",
[6263]="700529D7\n1\tCollect stolen supplies (total: 15)\tOrcs have stolen many traders' wares by ambushing them on the road to Arhaim. You should collect the stolen supplies from the Orc camp Brafulug.\n2\tTalk to Lúfred\tYou have retrieved the stolen supplies from the Orc camp. You should return to Lúfred at the Beorning watchpost to inform him.\n",
[6264]="7003A4C3\n1\tTalk to the soothsayer\tHildegard the soothsayer resides in a cave on the cliff overlooking Woodhurst. Gifemund asked you to speak with Hildegard the Soothsayer on his behalf.\n2\tTalk to Herubrand\tHerubrand is in the cellar of the farmhouse. You should tell Herubrand of your meeting with Hildegard on behalf of Gifemund.\n3\tTalk to Gifemund\tGifemund awaits your return in the ore refinery near the centre of Woodhurst. Herubrand bade you return to Gifemund with Hildegard's words.\n",
[6265]="700379DC\n1\tParticipate in Hildith's Council\tHildith is in the Mead Hall of Grimslade. You should speak with Hildith.\n2\tSpeak with Dunward outside the Mead Hall\tDunward is outside of the Mead Hall in Grimslade. You should speak with Dunward.\n",
[6266]="7001928A\n1\tDefeat goblins (total: 6)\tGoblins can be found to the south-west of Frerin's Court, up on the slopes of the mountains. Dwalin has asked you to deal with the goblins encamped near Thorin's Hall.\n2\tTalk to Dwalin at Frerin's Court\tDwalin can be found in Frerin's Court, north-east of the goblin-camp. You should return to Dwalin with news of your success.\n",
[6267]="7000173B\n1\tCollect brooches from Hillmen (total: 8)\tThe Hillmen are encamped near the mouth of the eastern entrance to Ram Dúath, north-east of Esteldín. You should collect brooches from the Hillmen, so that the composition of their forces may be determined.\n2\tReturn to Melthindir\tMelthindir stands outside of Esteldín, looking out onto eastern Nan Amlug. You should return to Melthindir with the brooches you collected.\n",
[6268]="700571E9\n1\tTalk to Skarding Wargsbane at Thokvist\tSkarding can be found at Thokvist. You should talk to Skarding.\n2\tFind a suitable hill to scout Lumrog\tThe hill Skarding speaks of can be found near Thokvist in Misthallow. You should scout the situation at Lumrog from atop a nearby hill.\n3\tFind another hill nearby\tThere must be another nearby hill in Misthallow. You should find another nearby hill.\n4\tGather wood for a fire (total: 8)\tWood can be found in Misthallow. You should gather wood from Misthallow.\n5\tBuild a fire on the hilltop\tThe second hill you found is in Misthallow. You should build a fire on the hill.\n6\tLight the fire on the hilltop\tThe second hill you found is in Misthallow. You should light the fire on the hill.\n7\tTalk to Egraedir about the fire\tEgraedir can be found in Misthallow. You should talk to Egraedir about the fire.\n8\tLook out towards the encampment of Lumrog\tThe hill with a good view of Lumrog can be found in Misthallow. You should scout Lumrog from afar.\n9\tTalk to Skarding Wargsbane at Thokvist\tSkarding can be found at Thokvist. You should report back to Skarding.\n",
[6269]="70018F82\n1\tDefeat Orc waylayers in Nanduhirion (total: 4)\tOrc waylayers can be found all along the road that runs through Nanduhirion, north-west of Talan Haldir. Maethoron has asked you to waylay the waylayers in Nanduhirion so that the road may be made safe.\n2\tTalk to Maethoron\tMaethoron is on Talan Haldir, near the banks of Nimrodel, south-east of Nanduhirion. You have defeated many of the Orc Waylayers that make travel on the road through Nanduhirion difficult, and should report of your success to Maethoron.\n",
[6270]="70052EC7\n1\tDestroy tainted barrels (total: 8)\tTainted barrels can be found at Côs Braen in Laerlad. You should destroy any tainted barrels you find.\n2\tCompleted\tDestroyed many tainted barrels at Côs Braen.\n",
[6271]="70030DAD\n1\tDestroy drake-eggs\t\n2\tDestroy drake-eggs (total: 15)\tDrake-eggs can be found in nests throughout the Wyrmdelf. You should destroy any drake-eggs you find in the Wyrmdelf.\n",
[6272]="70026B57\n1\tDig in moist earth for worms\030Place worms in the bait-bucket (total: 5)\tMoist earth, the perfect breeding ground for worms, is just north of the fishing area and across the small bridge. You should dig up worms in the moist earth and place them in the bait-bucket nearby.\n2\tTell Petunia Hornblower that the bait is ready\tPetunia Hornblower is cowering near the Fishing Hole in the Shire. You should speak with Petunia Hornblower and tell her that the bait is ready.\n3\tHook the bait for Petunia Hornblower\tThe bait bucket is right where you left it, just to the north of the Fishing Hole. You should bait the fishing line for Petunia Hornblower.\n4\tBring the baited pole to Petunia Hornblower\tPetunia Hornblower is likely still cowering at the Fishing Hole in Bywater. You should bring the baited fishing line to Petunia Hornblower.\n5\tCatch suitable Dinner Fish (total: 5)\tFish can be caught in the pond in Bywater. You must use your knowledge of fishing to catch fish out of the Fishing Hole for Petunia Hornblower's dinner.\n6\tShow the fish you caught to Petunia Hornblower\tPetunia Hornblower is near the Fishing Hole in Bywater. You should bring the fish you caught to Petunia Hornblower, for surely she will be satisfied with the catch after all the effort you put in on her behalf.\n7\tBring the fish to Hal Hornblower in Hobbiton\tHal Hornblower is in the centre of Hobbiton, the town to the west and just north of Bywater. You should bring the fish you cought to Petunia Hornblower's sibling, Hal Hornblower.\n8\tConvince Petunia Hornblower to let you be done with helping her for today\tYour general goodness inspired you to help a young hobbit-lass in distress; perhaps you will think twice about doing so again. Petunia Hornblower is at the Fishing Hole in Bywater. You should return to Petunia Hornblower, and hopefully she will now release you from your contract with her.\n",
})
